<div id="recipe-49053-instructions" class="wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-49053-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal" data-recipe="49053"><h3 class="wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none" style="">Instructions</h3><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-49053-step-0-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;"><strong>To make the salad dressing:</strong> Whisk together maple syrup, dijon mustard, garlic, apple cider vinegar, olive oil, salt and pepper in a small bowl or in a mason jar. Add in the sliced red onion and let it steep in it as you work on the rest of the ingredients.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-apple-coleslaw-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="A collage of images showing the making of the dressing." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-apple-coleslaw-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-apple-coleslaw-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-apple-coleslaw-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-apple-coleslaw-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-apple-coleslaw.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-apple-coleslaw.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-49053-step-0-1" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;"><strong>To make the Apple Kale Slaw:</strong> Place kale, shredded carrots and sliced red cabbage in a bowl. Drizzle it with the dressing. Using clean hands, give them a light massage making sure to distribute the dressing evenly throughout the salad. As you massage, the tough kale leaves will soften.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/apple-and-kale-slaw-recipe-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Person showing how to massage kale for the slaw." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/apple-and-kale-slaw-recipe-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/apple-and-kale-slaw-recipe-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/apple-and-kale-slaw-recipe-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/apple-and-kale-slaw-recipe-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/apple-and-kale-slaw-recipe.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/apple-and-kale-slaw-recipe.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-49053-step-0-2" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Top it off with sliced apple and sunflower seeds. Give it a toss and serve.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="350" height="217" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-slaw-with-apple-350x217.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="" srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-slaw-with-apple-350x217.jpg 350w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-slaw-with-apple-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-slaw-with-apple-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-slaw-with-apple-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-slaw-with-apple.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 350px) 100vw, 350px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Kale-slaw-with-apple.jpg"></div> </li></ul></div></div>
